  <UserdefinedSymbols />
  <Comments>Original Knight v1, Steam BatmanAK.exe x64, single-player only. No console, executable hooks, armor, XP/points, puzzle bypass or global time changes. All features require user gameplay testing. Infinite Health replenishes living on-foot player HP; not immunity to instant death or scripts. Damage caps nearby loaded eligible enemy pawn HP; disable around tutorials, scripted encounters and bosses. Off stops damage edits but does not restore lost enemy HP. Batarang/gadget damage is NOT yet claimed supported. Reach changes current player inventory items only and restores their floats on disable if identity still matches. Long range cannot create grapple targets or bypass line of sight/streaming. Teleports require walking/falling and same pawn/world; no collision/streaming safety. J/K/L save/teleport/undo; F1-F4 up 1/2/5/10 body heights; main -/= damage toggles. No Batmobile support yet. Initial reflected offsets and live HP 100/100 independently inspected; simulated write tests do not establish gameplay success. Back up saves and use one table version at a time.</Comments>
</CheatTable>